==Battleground==
*1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Duche]]s spawn after 21.33 seconds<sup>640f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 22.67 seconds<sup>680f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Duche]]s spawn after 31.33 seconds<sup>940f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring at least one [[:Category:Tanker-class Cats|Tanker-class Cat]], preferably [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] since they work well against the Red enemies. Aside from that, attempt to keep a consistent flow of [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] such as [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Sorceress Cat]] until all the Shy Boys are dead, then focus entirely on your Meatshields and Tanks.

